    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A chess game without any chess. Rearrange your troops to bring your best knights back to your Kingdom in an abstract medieval world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Featuring:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 80 hand-crafted levels with increasing complexity;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A fun chess puzzle now available to everyone (even to those who never played chess);</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Beautiful, abstract world inspired by Medieval Times;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Originally composed music to help you focus and relax while solving the puzzles.</p></li></ul>",
